Doors
=====

Built for the UBS AI Financial Twin Challenge (LauzHack 2026). An independent project: see DISCLAIMER.md.

Challenge material, included unchanged
--------------------------------------
The synthetic data in `Data/` and the starter kit in `starter-kit/` were produced by [Nom] ([lien LinkedIn]),
challenge author and information owner. They are included with her permission. They are not covered by the
licence of this project's own code, and they are not ours to relicense.

A few figures of the fictional persona (savings, rent, goals) and of the starter kit (salaries, expenses) are
quoted in `engine/assumptions.py` and `engine/scenarios/alexia.json`, each with its source file.

